Extra KDL writer probes for Sandy: `{person:{name:'A',age:3}}` -> `person name="A" age=3
`; `{parent:{child:{a:1},x:2}}` -> `parent x=2 {
  child a=1
}
`; `{people:[{name:'A'},{name:'B'}]}` emits repeated `people name=...` nodes; `{a:{list:[1,2]}}` uses braced `a { ... }` with list nodes. @sandy_walnut42
